  "details": "A way to see which avatar on the map is playing a sound effect.\n\nSomething like the voice chat indicator, but for sound effects. It could be super helpful in situations where there’s a lot going on, and you’re trying to figure out where a sound is coming from.\n\nIt would also be super useful for private group instances with more than 50 people, where it can get really chaotic trying to figure out who’s playing a sound effect. This could make large group events less chaotic and more enjoyable for everyone. Plus, it would make instance moderation a lot easier.",
